d  you you're kind of having to contort  yourself and I'm not in those flexible  person a look on her face you know that  she's thinking about one thing and  that's about getting me out and then the  challenge was that as she was digging  snow was falling on top of me like every  five seconds I was having to their white  nail off the front of the lens and then  take a picture my gut said I was soaked  good you know I think if you were  seriously buried an avalanche you can  imagine the feeling that you must be  having when you see her a retriever  digging the hole open and saving your  life I mean it's got to be a moment  [Music]  you always don't think that you've got  the shot and there's a saying that if  you think you've got the shot then you  don't and so you always have this worry  did I get the picture did I get the  picture and when you get a photo that  you're happy with it's it's like  Christmas  what I'm thinking about all the time is  what a gram and Erna doing that is  special and what do I think is important  to tell they're out there saving  people's lives every single day  [Music]

